[version]
1.3.1
[date]
2026-10-21
[whatsnew]
- File Manager v2 (usr/bin/filemanager.lua) - completely rewritten:
  * Path breadcrumb bar on each pane
  * Status bar showing file size, type, modified
  * Sort by name/size/date (cycle with 's')
  * Filter files with '/' (substring match)
  * Confirmation dialogs with Y/N (no accidental deletes)
  * Input dialogs for rename/mkdir/newfile
  * Progress bar for copy/move operations
  * Quick-jump to file by pressing first letter
  * Bookmarks: Ctrl+1..5 save, Alt+1..5 jump
  * Color-coded icons by file extension
  * 'h' toggles hidden files, 'q' quits
- New cleanup command (bin/cleanup.lua) - frees disk space
- Help command updated with new apps and detailed filemanager hotkeys
[/whatsnew]
[files]
usr/bin/filemanager.lua
bin/help.lua
bin/cleanup.lua
latest_update.upd
[/files]
